(7675839, 1254163, 65234, '<td valign="top">I will admit I saw this on FB but I was blown away then and I still am. The poses, the costumes, the composition, the light ... extraordinary. That central demon figure is so cool! Very, very well done. I think it''s even better than the one you did years ago, and I was impressed by that one.</td>', 'I will admit I saw this on FB but I was blown away then and I still am. The poses, the costumes, the composition, the light ... extraordinary. That central demon figure is so cool! Very, very well done. I think it''s even better than the one you did years ago, and I was impressed by that one.', '2020-10-03 17:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
