(7676201, 1254572, 115664, '<td valign="top">We raised her from a very tiny baby after her family was blown up by angry farmers! We are licensed rehabilitotors. She will stay with us about another year (baby beavers stay with their families about 2 years) then we will find a suitable and safe place for her to go and live in the wild as a released beaver. She is not confined and may leave of her own accord at any time but we have a pond and everything she needs here for right now. Just not other beavers for her to socialize with. :-)</td>', 'We raised her from a very tiny baby after her family was blown up by angry farmers! We are licensed rehabilitotors. She will stay with us about another year (baby beavers stay with their families about 2 years) then we will find a suitable and safe place for her to go and live in the wild as a released beaver. She is not confined and may leave of her own accord at any time but we have a pond and everything she needs here for right now. Just not other beavers for her to socialize with. :-)', '2020-10-08 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 0),
